  closure {S, T} = ⊤` — the issue's first corpus hit, used here through `sl2zGenerators`.
* `Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:932`, `:935`, `:941`, `:972` — `S`, `T`,
