* K. Conrad, *SL₂(ℤ)*, Corollary 2.3 and Appendix C, Theorem C.1 (the amalgam `ℤ/2 * ℤ/3` for
  `PSL₂`), and J. Milne, *Modular Functions and Modular Forms* v1.31, Remark 2.14, as recorded in
  the issue body; the texts are not re-opened here, and no statement below depends on them beyond
