## Search done (lean-categories#89, LC-09)

Repository: `rg -l "PresentedGroup"` (2 hits, `Topology/CayleyComplexData.lean`,
`Homological/SteinbergGroup.lean`), `rg -l "SL2Z|SpecialLinearGroup"` (4 hits, none about a
presentation). Formalization corpus, 2026-11-04: `SL2Z_generators` (23 files, 32 matches),
